# Optional. Lets the site ask Google Gemini to understand a plan it cannot read by itself (a photo, a scan).
# Server-side only: never prefix with VITE_ (that would ship the key to every visitor's browser).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: pin one model instead of the built-in chain (Pro first, then Flash).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
